  Slug: alloysmith
  DisplayName: Alloysmith
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Blacksmithing might be an ancient profession, but you are its cutting
    edge. You've studied the properties of different metals, experimented with them
    by combining them, exposing them to different elements and processes, and have
    even delved into the metaphysical nature of metal in your quest to master it.
    You might have taken up adventuring to acquire more funding and materials or
    to test your designs. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or
    Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Crafting
    skill and the Plane of Metal Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Specialty
    Crafting] skill feat with the blacksmithing specialty.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Rage of Elements
